The background slides name their own sources: MITRE ATT&CK and the csoh.org glossary.

== Related kill chains and defense topics
layout: links
link: Scattered Spider / MGM | breaches/scattered-spider-mgm.html
link: Okta support system, October 2023 | breaches/okta-support-har.html
link: IAM and cloud identity | iam.html
link: SaaS security (SSPM) | saas-security.html
link: Incident response | incident-response.html
