The page says Scattered Spider obtained the same capability at MGM eighteen months later, and that Okta's support organization was breached again in October 2023, by a different route.
notes:
Two related kill chains on csoh.org, and the page's related defense topics.

At stage 02, the page says the ability to reset passwords and MFA is the same capability Scattered Spider obtained by phoning a help desk at MGM eighteen months later.

At stage 04, it says Okta was breached again through its support organization in October 2023, by a different route, which is why the two chains sit on the site separately.

The four defense topics the page links are IAM and cloud identity, SaaS security, incident response, and GRC and vendor risk. IAM is identity and access management. SaaS is software as a service, and SSPM is SaaS security posture management. GRC is governance, risk and compliance.
